{
	"_type": "Project",
	"_id": "ActivityDiagram_Admin_PantauDashboard_Project",
	"name": "Activity Diagram - Admin Pantau Dashboard",
	"ownedElements": [
		{
			"_type": "UMLModel",
			"_id": "ActivityDiagram_Admin_PantauDashboard_Model",
			"_parent": {
				"$ref": "ActivityDiagram_Admin_PantauDashboard_Project"
			},
			"name": "Admin Pantau Dashboard Model",
			"ownedElements": [
				{
					"_type": "UMLActivityDiagram",
					"_id": "ActivityDiagram_Admin_PantauDashboard",
					"_parent": {
						"$ref": "ActivityDiagram_Admin_PantauDashboard_Model"
					},
					"name": "Activity Diagram - Admin Pantau Dashboard",
					"ownedViews": [],
					"documentation": "Activity diagram untuk pantau dashboard admin.\n\nDeskripsi:\n1. Admin login ke sistem\n2. Sistem menampilkan dashboard dengan statistik:\n   - Total guru, siswa, kelas\n   - Statistik presensi hari ini (hadir, izin, sakit, alpa)\n   - Grafik presensi mingguan/bulanan\n   - Daftar pengumuman terbaru\n   - Permintaan izin pending\n   - Permintaan reset password pending\n3. Admin dapat filter data berdasarkan periode/kelas\n4. Admin dapat export laporan dalam format PDF/Excel\n5. Admin dapat melihat detail dengan klik pada statistik tertentu"
				},
				{
					"_type": "UMLActivity",
					"_id": "Activity_AdminPantauDashboard",
					"_parent": {
						"$ref": "ActivityDiagram_Admin_PantauDashboard_Model"
					},
					"name": "Pantau Dashboard Admin",
					"ownedElements": [
						{
							"_type": "UMLActivityNode",
							"_id": "InitialNode_Start",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "Activity_AdminPantauDashboard"
							},
							"name": "Start"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLActivityNode",
							"_id": "Action_LoginSistem",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "Activity_AdminPantauDashboard"
							},
							"name": "Admin Login ke Sistem"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLActivityNode",
							"_id": "Action_LoadDataDashboard",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "Activity_AdminPantauDashboard"
							},
							"name": "Sistem Load Data Dashboard"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLActivityNode",
							"_id": "Action_TampilkanStatistik",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "Activity_AdminPantauDashboard"
							},
							"name": "Tampilkan Statistik (Total Guru, Siswa, Kelas)"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLActivityNode",
							"_id": "Action_TampilkanPresensi",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "Activity_AdminPantauDashboard"
							},
							"name": "Tampilkan Statistik Presensi Hari Ini"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLActivityNode",
							"_id": "Action_TampilkanGrafik",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "Activity_AdminPantauDashboard"
							},
							"name": "Tampilkan Grafik Presensi (Mingguan/Bulanan)"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLActivityNode",
							"_id": "Action_TampilkanPengumumanTerbaru",
